  "description": "Single storey side to rear extension; front porch (retrospective)",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The development\r\nis located within surface water flood risk medium and high in the absence of a\r\nsatisfactory Flood Risk Assessment, it has not been demonstrated that the development would not exacerbate the risk of flooding within the site\r\nor increase the risk and consequences of flooding elsewhere, contrary to\r\nNational Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy SI 12 of The London Plan\r\n(2021), Policy CN4 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The front porch, side and rear extension as built, does not resemble the submitted plans. Furthermore, the submitted floor and roof plans show differing depths of the single storey rear extension. Therefore, the local planning authority is unable to fully and accurately assess the development.&amp;nbsp; In the absence of which the proposal could give rise to detrimental harm, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 D(7) of The&amp;nbsp; London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
